    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5733734406,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-a5035cb043f8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -51.06976194670071,
      "y": 402.87371417464897,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 371.7833251953125,
      "height": 122.5,
      "seed": 545625,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What Is Iceberg?\nIceberg is a table format. It keeps a list of the exact files that\nform a table at one point in time, together with the schema,\nthe partition rules, and per-file statistics. Because the file list\nis explicit metadata, an engine knows the table content\nwithout scanning storage, and a change becomes visible in\none atomic step.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-a5035cb043f8",
      "originalText": "What Is Iceberg?\nIceberg is a table format. It keeps a list of the exact files that form a table at one point in time, together with the schema, the partition rules, and per-file statistics. Because the file list is explicit metadata, an engine knows the table content without scanning storage, and a change becomes visible in one atomic step.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "what-is-iceberg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9365891036,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-a14e2f6b53cf",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 138.0084338597892,
      "y": 609.7060065954295,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 392.72247343951625,
