    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2476144130,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-a14e2f6b53cf",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 158.55300493013326,
      "y": 619.44877102783,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 351.6333312988281,
      "height": 105.0,
      "seed": 431689,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Table Format vs File Format\nA file format defines how rows are stored inside one file.\nParquet, ORC, and Avro are file formats. A table format\ndefines which files belong to the table, what the columns\nmean, and how a change is committed. Iceberg does not\nreplace Parquet; it organizes Parquet files into a table.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-a14e2f6b53cf",
      "originalText": "Table Format vs File Format\nA file format defines how rows are stored inside one file. Parquet, ORC, and Avro are file formats. A table format defines which files belong to the table, what the columns mean, and how a change is committed. Iceberg does not replace Parquet; it organizes Parquet files into a table.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "table-format-vs-file-format"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
