      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Engine Picks a Snapshot\nNormally the engine uses the current snapshot,\nso the whole query reads one consistent version.\nA time-travel query selects an older snapshot by\nID or by timestamp instead.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-d218bdfb78e5",
      "originalText": "Engine Picks a Snapshot\nNormally the engine uses the current snapshot, so the whole query reads one consistent version. A time-travel query selects an older snapshot by ID or by timestamp instead.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
