    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4854105818,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-d2bc0fe69e38",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1900.0,
      "y": 6008.75,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 210.0,
      "seed": 269498,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Common Catalogs\nThe Iceberg REST catalog is an open API that a\nclient can talk to, and several products\nimplement it: Apache Polaris, Project Nessie,\nLakekeeper, and the catalog services of the\ncloud and lakehouse vendors. Other widely used\noptions are the AWS Glue Data Catalog, the\nHive Metastore, Databricks Unity Catalog,\nSnowflake Open Catalog, a JDBC catalog backed\nby a relational database, and the filesystem\ncatalog, which is easy to start with but weak\nfor concurrent writers.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-d2bc0fe69e38",
      "originalText": "Common Catalogs\nThe Iceberg REST catalog is an open API that a client can talk to, and several products implement it: Apache Polaris, Project Nessie, Lakekeeper, and the catalog services of the cloud and lakehouse vendors. Other widely used options are the AWS Glue Data Catalog, the Hive Metastore, Databricks Unity Catalog, Snowflake Open Catalog, a JDBC catalog backed by a relational database, and the filesystem catalog, which is easy to start with but weak for concurrent writers.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "common-catalogs"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1152053975,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-79c9122e4ce1",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1289.2,
      "y": 6281.25,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 410.40000000000003,
      "height": 146.5,
      "seed": 5106,
      "groupIds": [],
